#: admin/views/duckdb/partials/section-retrieval-quality.php:5
msgid "Retrieval quality"
msgstr ""

#: admin/views/duckdb/partials/section-retrieval-quality.php:8
msgid "Hybrid BM25 + vector"
msgstr ""

#: admin/views/duckdb/partials/section-retrieval-quality.php:12
msgid ""
"Blend BM25 full-text scores with vector similarity to choose and order the "
"matches; the score MxChat receives stays the cosine similarity. Requires the "
"DuckDB FTS extension and the visitor's query text, which the Pinecone proxy "
"(Option B) supplies on its own; on any other path, return it from the "
"`mxchat_plus_duckdb_query_text` filter."
msgstr ""

#: admin/views/duckdb/partials/section-retrieval-quality.php:17
msgid "Hybrid α (vector weight)"
msgstr ""

#: admin/views/duckdb/partials/section-retrieval-quality.php:22
msgid ""
"1.0 = pure vector, 0.0 = pure BM25. 0.7 is a sensible default for factual "
"KBs."
msgstr ""

#: admin/views/duckdb/partials/section-retrieval-quality.php:26
msgid "Dedup per source"
msgstr ""

#: admin/views/duckdb/partials/section-retrieval-quality.php:30
msgid ""
"Keep only the highest-scoring chunk per source_url in the top-K (avoids "
"passing N near-duplicate chunks from the same article to the LLM)."
msgstr ""

